      "headingType": "anuccheda",
      "sourceStartLine": 2626,
      "content": "\\n\\n     The body of a liberated soul is also described in these words of\\n�r�mad-Bh�gavatam (8.3.19):\\n\\n\\nya� dharma-k�m�rtha. . .r�ty api deham avyayam\\n\\n\\n     \"After worshiping the Supreme Personality of Godhead, those who are\\ninterested in the four principles of religion, economic development, sense\\ngratification and liberation obtain from Him what they desire. What, then,\\nis be said of other benedictions? Indeed, sometimes the Lord gives a\\nspiritual body to such ambitious worshipers.\"*\\n\\n     �r�la �r�dhara Sv�m� comments:\\n\\n     \"In this way the Supreme Lord gives the devotee an eternal spiritual\\nbody.\"\\n\\n"
