      "headingType": "anuccheda",
      "sourceStartLine": 4334,
      "content": "\\n\\n     What is the opinion of the advanced transcendentalists, the persons\\nwho know the real truth? The Supreme Personality of Godhead Himself\\nexplains (�r�mad-Bh�gavatam 3.9.42):\\n\\n\\naham �tm�taman�� dh�ta�\\n     pre��ha� san preyas�m api\\nato mayi rati� kury�d\\n     deh�dir yat-k�te priya�\\n\\n\\n     \"I am the Supersoul of every individual. I am the supreme director and\\nthe dearest. People are wrongly attached to the gross and subtle bodies,\\nbut they should be attached to Me only.\"*\\n\\n     In this verse the Supreme Personality of Godhead says: {.sy 168}I\\n(aham) am the Supersoul (�tm�). I am like the sun, and the of individual\\nsouls (�tman�m), are like the rays of My sunlight.\"\\n\\n     This is also described in these words of �r�mad-Bh�gavatam (10.14.55):\\n\\n\\nk���am enam avehi tvam\\n     �tm�nam akhil�tman�m\\n\\n\\n     \"You should know K���a as the original soul of all �tm�s (living\\nentities).\"*\\n\\n     in �r�mad-Bh�gavatam 3.9.42.the Supreme Personality of Godhead\\ndeclares: \"I am supremely pure. I am the dearest (pre��ha) of all dear\\nthings (preyas�m). People are wrongly attached to the gross and subtle\\nbodies (k�te deh�dibhir priya�), but they should be attached to Me only.\"\\nThese words mean: \"They who have the fault of not understanding Me do not\\ndo everything for Me.\" This verse was spoken by �r� Garbhodaka��y� Vi��u to\\nthe demigod Brahm�.\\n\\n"
