      "content": "\\n\\n     The love the devotees pray to attain is described in these words of\\nQueen Kunt� in �r�mad-Bh�gavatam (1.8.42):\\n\\n\\ntvayi me 'nanya-vi�ay�\\n     matir madhu-pate'sakrt\\nratim udvahat�d addh�\\n     ga�gevaugham udanvati\\n\\n\\n     \"O Lord of Madhu, as the Ganges forever flows to the sea without\\nhindrance, let my attraction be constamtly drawn unto You without being\\ndiverted to anyone else.\"*\\n\\n"
