      "content": "\\n\\n     The great glory of �r� Pradyumna is described in these words of �r�mad-\\nBh�gavatam (10.55.33):\\n\\n\\nkatha� tv anena sampr�pta�\\n     s�r�pya� ��r�ga-dhanvana�\\n�k�ty�vayavair gaty�\\n     svara-h�s�valokanai�\\n\\n\\n     \"But how is it that this young man so much resembles my own Lord,\\nK���a, the wielder of ��r�ga, in his bodily form and His limbs, in His gait\\nand the tone of His voice, and in His smiling glance?\"***\\n\\n     The meaning of these words is clear. This verse was spoken by �r�\\nRukmi��.\\n\\n"
