      "content": "\\n\\n     V�tsalya-rasa is wonderful with many vibh�vas and other bh�vas. Even\\nbefore the devotees have seen Lord K���a for the first time, these\\necstasies are manifest. This is seen in the following words of �r�mad-\\nBh�gavatam (10.5.9):\\n\\n\\ngopya� c�kar�ya mudit�\\n     ya�od�y�� s�todbhavam\\n�t�ana� bh��ay�� cakrur\\n     vastr�kalp��jan�dibhi�\\n\\n\\n     \"The gop� wives of the cowherd men were very pleased to hear that\\nmother Ya�od� had given birth to a son, and they began to decorate\\nthemselves very nicely with proper dresses, ornaments, black ointment for\\nthe eyes, and so on.\"*\\n\\n     The meaning of this verse is clear. This verse was spoken by �r�la\\n�ukadeva Gosv�m�.\\n\\n"
